<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Order Confirmation - CushyAccess</title>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f8f9fa; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding: 20px 0;">
        <table role="presentation" width="600" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); overflow: hidden; max-width: 600px;">

          <!-- Header -->
          <tr>
            <td style=" color: #524e4e; padding: 40px; text-align: center;">
              <h1 style="font-size: 26px; margin: 0;">✅ Order Confirmed</h1>
              <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 8px;">Thank you for shopping with Cushy Access!</p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Body Content -->
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 40px 30px;">
              <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #333333; margin-bottom: 20px;">
                Hello <strong>{{customerName}}</strong>,
              </p>
              <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563;">
                Your order placed on <strong>{{orderDate}}</strong> has been received successfully. Here’s a summary of your order:
              </p>

              <!-- Order Summary -->
              <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin: 20px 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #374151; width: 40%;">Store Name:</td>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #6b7280;">{{storeName}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #374151;">Store Address:</td>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #6b7280;">{{storeAddress}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #374151;">Delivery Fee:</td>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 0; color: #6b7280;">₦{{deliveryFee}}</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #374151;">Total Amount:</td>
                  <td style="padding: 8px 0; font-weight: 600; color: #10b981;">₦{{totalAmount}}</td>
                </tr>
              </table>
              <!-- Delivery Code -->
              <p style="font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563; margin-top: 20px;">
                Your delivery code is: <strong style="color: #10b981;">{{deliveryCode}}</strong>. Please keep this code safe as it will be provided to the rider upon arrival.
              </p>

              <!-- Items Table -->
              <h3 style="font-size: 18px; color: #1f2937; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 10px;">📦 Items Ordered</h3>
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse: collapse; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #f9fafb;">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th align="left" style="font-size: 14px; color: #374151; padding: 8px;">Item Name</th>
                    <th align="left" style="font-size: 14px; color: #374151; padding: 8px;">Quantity</th>
                    <th align="left" style="font-size: 14px; color: #374151; padding: 8px;">Price (₦)</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {{#each items}}
                  <tr style="border-top: 1px solid #f3f4f6;">
                    <td style="color: #4b5563; padding: 8px;">
                      {{name}}
                      {{#if options}}
                      <div style="font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; margin-top: 4px;">{{options}}</div>
                      {{/if}}
                    </td>
                    <td style="color: #4b5563; padding: 8px;">{{quantity}}</td>
                    <td style="color: #4b5563; padding: 8px;">{{price}}</td>
                  </tr>
                  {{/each}}
                </tbody>
              </table>

              <!-- Thank You Note -->
              <p style="margin-top: 30px; font-size: 15px; color: #4b5563;">
                We’ll notify you once your items are out for delivery. You can also track your order from your dashboard.
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

          <!-- Footer -->
          <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #1f2937; padding: 30px 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;">
              <p style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600; margin: 0 0 10px 0;">CushyAccess</p>
              <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 0 10px;">Your Trusted Logistics Partner</p>
              <p style="color: #9ca3af; font-size: 14px;">Empowering e-commerce businesses with seamless delivery solutions</p>

              <!-- Footer Links -->
              <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="margin: 20px 0;">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center">
                    <a href="https://cushyaccess.com/support/" style="color: #a855f7; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 15px;">Support Center</a>
                    <a href="https://wa.link/jwg3s5" style="color: #a855f7; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 15px;">Contact Us</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <!-- Social Links -->
              <table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0">
                <tr>
                  <td align="center">
                    <a href="#" style="color: #6b7280; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px;">LinkedIn</a>
                    <a href="https://x.com/cushy_access" style="color: #6b7280; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px;">Twitter</a>
                    <a href="https://facebook.com/cushyaccess" style="color: #6b7280; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 10px;">Facebook</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280;">
                © 2026 CushyAccess. All rights reserved.<br>
                Tunga Roundabout, Minna Niger State, Nigeria.<br>
                <a href="#" style="color: #a855f7; text-decoration: none;">Unsubscribe</a> |
                <a href="https://cushyaccess.com/privacy/" style="color: #a855f7; text-decoration: none;">Privacy Policy</a>
              </p>
            </td>
          </tr>

        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</body>
</html>
